      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Not necessarily. I have chairs on my bigger avatars because it's fun to lift my friends up to high places and carry them around on my shoulders.\n\nThat's also not a great attitude towards player safety. It's arguably a form of victim blaming.",
